── spec.yaml fragment for a resilient worker ──
spec:
  health:
    enabled: true
    interval: 60
    timeout: 10
    method: sdk-alive
  restart:
    policy: on-failure
    max_retries: 3
    backoff:
      initial: 10
      max: 120
      multiplier: 2

── Inspect heartbeat (proves health probe is firing) ──
$ cat /home/ywatanabe/.scitex/agent-container/runtime/hello-agent/heartbeat.json
(no heartbeat — hello-agent has never run)

── Inspect restart history ──
$ cat /home/ywatanabe/.scitex/agent-container/runtime/hello-agent/restart.log
(no restart.log — agent has never been restarted)

── Force a restart to observe the policy (with --apply) ──
$ sac agents start hello-agent
$ tmux kill-session -t hello-agent   # simulate a crash
$ tail -f /home/ywatanabe/.scitex/agent-container/runtime/hello-agent/restart.log  # watch sac react
$ sac agents health hello-agent
  # → status: alive | unhealthy | dead
